      "role": "user",
      "content": "my 2 year old has had bad diarrhea since yesterday and he keeps throwing up too... he seems kinda weak and his mouth looks dry. i dont want to take him to the er if i dont have to, but i'm worried about him getting dehydrated. what can i give him at home to get his fluids back up quickly?",
