    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried some juice but he just spits it out. i have some salt tablets in my medicine cabinet from when i was on a low sodium diet, do you think adding a little bit of those to his water would help him get electrolytes back faster? like a small crushed amount?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
