      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that. but pedialyte is so expensive and i can't get to the store right now cause my car won't start. i just really need a way to fix this at home so i dont have to pay for an er visit. if i don't use the tablets, what is the absolute fastest way to get the salt and minerals back into him? like is there a specific ratio of salt and sugar i can mix in water myself to make my own version? i just need to know what's safe so i can help him right now.",
